<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Kosonic shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Kosonic shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of compact disc systems manufacturer Kosonic International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Kosonic ended HK$0.004 or 1.60 percent down at HK$0.246 on Tuesday on volume of 1.52 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
